{{inh+|fr|frm|vif}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|vif}}, from {{inh|fr|la|vīvus||alive, living}}, from {{inh|fr|itc-pro|*gʷīwos}}, ultimately from {{inh|fr|ine-pro|*gʷih₃wós||alive}}.

